{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは🍨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、横浜で個別握手会でした!\n来てくれてありがとう☺️今日は、いつもより暑かった気がします。\nもう、夏が近づいてるのかな🍉\nそろそろ半袖着てもいいかなって思いました。\n夏フェスとか行きたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、服と髪型を載せますね〜\n1部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNY7Z3EG34Z75TSQK4SA7M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nりぼんフェスタで作った ふるあんモチーフのヘアピン🐇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNY8ZXK3WKE3KRS95R2VT8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nストレートの内巻きこれが1番落ち着く髪型かも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYA10MBK716VMK535AZ94","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セーラー服ぽい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYAYVD1505G00JGMJ7Y60","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n巻いたよ〜大人ぽいって言われて嬉しかった😇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYBY776X96YM8WNK7REDA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこういうの、あんま着ないかも。\nあと、初めてのヘアアレンジ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYCY1R7M6A3YHSXCQHMH4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n羊ヘア🐑らしい。夏とかしたら涼しそう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYDW4ZZ9A9XS21QCJX9DF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りぼんだらけ🎀"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYEWSRJ2KWATS276AZJCF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n編み込み三つ編み。\nぺーちゃんに褒めてもらえた髪型!嬉しい🍞\nぺー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYFXYEH2XPRMTAHKBX0E8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nいつも優しい\n一緒に遊園地行く予定!楽しみだ☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}